gin="2:53.247" end="2:53.745">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也只是随心而动</span></p><p begin="2:54.170" end="2:59.370" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.170" end="2:54.754">皆</span><span begin="2:54.754" end="2:55.194">が</span><span begin="2:55.194" end="2:55.342">い</span><span begin="2:55.342" end="2:55.490">い</span><span begin="2:55.490" end="2:55.721">と</span><span begin="2:55.721" end="2:56.117">思</span><span begin="2:56.118" end="2:56.290">う</span><span begin="2:56.290" end="2:56.898">曲</span><span begin="2:56.898" end="2:57.194">や</span><span begin="2:57.194" end="2:57.698">歌</span><span begin="2:57.698" end="2:58.042">が</span><span begin="2:58.042" end="2:58.690">響</span><span begin="2:58.690" end="2:58.994">か</span><span begin="2:58.994" end="2:59.146">な</span><span begin="2:59.146" end="2:59.370">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">人们所认同的歌声和乐曲都无法使我得到慰籍</span></p><p begin="2:59.370" end="3:02.050" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.370" end="2:59.842">弱</span><span begin="2:59.842" end="3:00.058">る</span><span begin="3:00.058" end="3:00.498">夜</span><span begin="3:00.498" end="3:00.786">を</span><span begin="3:00.786" end="3:01.202">肯</span><span begin="3:01.202" end="3:01.578">定</span><span begin="3:01.578" end="3:01.746">し</span><span begin="3:01.746" end="3:02.050">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">反而肯定了那些让我脆弱的夜晚</span></p><p begin="3:02.050" end="3:06.391" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:02.050" end="3:02.250">そ</span><span begin="3:02.250" end="3:02.554">の</span><span begin="3:02.554" end="3:02.954">手</span><span begin="3:02.954" end="3:03.490">時</span><span begin="3:03.490" end="3:03.738">に</span><span begin="3:03.738" end="3:03.946">は</span><span begin="3:03.946" end="3:04.178">借</span><span begin="3:04.178" end="3:04.398">り</span><span begin="3:04.398" end="3:04.582">て</span><span begin="3:04.582" end="3:04.718">み</span><span begin="3:04.718" en