 begin="3:15.975" end="3:16.264">は</span><span begin="3:16.264" end="3:16.514">ま</span><span begin="3:16.514" end="3:16.753">や</span><span begin="3:16.753" end="3:17.194">か</span><span begin="3:17.194" end="3:17.260">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在梦境里相会吗？只是虚幻的谎言罢了</span></p><p begin="3:17.260" end="3:21.319" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.260" end="3:17.492">で</span><span begin="3:17.492" end="3:17.684">も</span><span begin="3:17.684" end="3:17.852">そ</span><span begin="3:17.852" end="3:18.004">れ</span><span begin="3:18.004" end="3:18.436">は</span><span begin="3:18.436" end="3:18.884">僕</span><span begin="3:18.884" end="3:19.101">の</span><span begin="3:19.101" end="3:19.349">生</span><span begin="3:19.349" end="3:19.581">存</span><span begin="3:19.581" end="3:19.861">戦</span><span begin="3:19.861" end="3:20.197">略</span><span begin="3:20.197" end="3:20.413">な</span><span begin="3:20.413" end="3:20.629">ん</span><span begin="3:20.629" end="3:20.901">だ</span><span begin="3:20.901" end="3:21.319">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可这就是我得以生存的策略啊</span></p><p begin="3:21.319" end="3:26.182" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:21.319" end="3:21.544">孤</span><span begin="3:21.544" end="3:22.271">独</span><span begin="3:22.271" end="3:22.403">じ</span><span begin="3:22.403" end="3:22.535">ゃ</span><span begin="3:22.535" end="3:22.775">な</span><span begin="3:22.775" end="3:22.907">き</span><span begin="3:22.907" end="3:23.039">ゃ</span><span begin="3:23.039" end="3:23.559">眠</span><span begin="3:23.559" end="3:23.815">れ</span><span begin="3:23.815" end="3:24.519">な</span><span begin="3:24.519" end="3:24.904">い</span><span begin="3:25.159" end="3:25.479">眠</span><span begin="3:25.479" end="3:25.639">れ</span><span begin="3:25.639" end="3:25.808">な</span><span begin="3:25.808" end="3:26.182">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">失去孤独的我 难以安眠</span></p></div></body></tt>